Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:26.22,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Micro VMs, open core, born
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:26.22,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}as a Linux Foundation
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:26.22,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}project”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,I'm co-founder and chief
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:03.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,of product at Unikraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:05.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,We're a virtualization
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:06.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,company. We do micro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.57,0:00:09.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,VMs, we today actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.29,0:00:10.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,do something like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:11.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,sandboxes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.39,0:00:11.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,databases
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:12.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,this type of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:13.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,We're open core.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:14.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,We started out as a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:16.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Linux foundation project
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:17.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,about almost 10 years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:19.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,ago. and start building
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:20.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,basically what is the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.13,0:00:21.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,equivalent of a kernel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:23.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,that is Linux compatible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.03,0:00:24.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,and then kind of built a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:25.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,cloud platform around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,that.
